# play main-menu/00-tui-main -----------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the gallery's$
# fixture plans. Nothing on this machine changes: the simulated$
# system only records each step it would apply, and the record$
# is shown when play ends.$
# Each workflow plays its typed sequence, where it has one, else$
# its first.$
$
hardn  v0.4.0              https://github.com/abbott/hardn$
$
# Debian 12 (Bookworm) #########################################$
$
  [BOS-SAN-L01]            192.0.2.10$
                           182 days, 2 hours, 26 minutes$
$
  [*] Risk Level           Moderate ~ medium security$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, sudo$
  [+] Firewall             Configured deny policy$
  [+] SSH Login            Configured root disallowed$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured key-only auth$
  [+] SSH Port             Configured non-default (2230)$
  [ ] AppArmor             Not Configured$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured$
$
----------------------------------------------------------------$
$
  Select an option         Dry-run Mode Disabled$
$
   1) User Management      Create, Configure (sudo, SSH keys)$
   2) SSH Login            Toggle SSH root access$
   3) DNS                  Configure Nameservers$
   4) Firewall             Configure UFW rules$
   5) Backup               Configure Hardn backup settings$
   6) Dry-Run              Simulate changes$
   7) Run All              Execute hardening operations$
   8) Environment          Configure environment variable$
   9) System Details       View system information$
  10) Logs                 View log file$
$
   0) Exit                 q to quit$
$
  > Enter selection [0-10 or q]: 1$
$
